[al:新概念英语第二册]
[ti:37. The Olympic Games]
[00:00.920]Passage 37 | 文章三十七
[00:02.860]The Olympic Games. | 奥运会。
[00:05.890]The Olympic games will be held in our country in four years' time. | 奥运会将在四年后在我国举行。
[00:12.260]As a great many people will be visiting the country, | 由于将有很多人来我国参观，
[00:16.090]the government will be building new hotels, | 政府将修建新的宾馆、
[00:19.280]an immense stadium, | 一个巨大的体育场
[00:21.270]and a fine new swimming pool. | 和一个漂亮的新游泳池。
[00:24.325]They will also be building new roads | 他们还将修建新的公路
[00:27.675]and a special railway line. | 和一条专用铁路线。
[00:30.320]The games will be held just outside the capital, | 奥运会将在首都郊外举行，
[00:34.395]and the whole area will be called Olympic City. | 整个地区将被命名为奥林匹克城。
[00:39.500]Workers will have completed the new roads by the end of this year. | 到今年年底，工人们将建成新的公路。
[00:45.145]By the end of next year, | 到明年年底，
[00:47.575]they will have finished work on the new stadium. | 他们将完成新体育场的施工。
[00:50.835]The fine modern buildings have been designed by Kurt Gunter. | 这些漂亮的现代化建筑是由库尔特·冈瑟设计的。
[00:56.710]Everybody will be watching anxiously as the new buildings go up. | 随着新建筑的落成，每个人都将焦急地观看。
[01:02.445]We are all very excited | 我们都非常兴奋，
[01:05.335]and are looking forward to the Olympic Games | 并且期待着奥运会，
[01:08.495]because they have never been held before in this country. | 因为以前从未在我国举行过奥运会。